1
00:00:00,012 --> 00:00:01,252
(Director:)Yeah, but. ..

2
00:00:01,948 --> 00:00:03,688
(Leonard:)...there was ample parking.

3
00:00:05,351 --> 00:00:06,491
(Penny:)Are you done?

4
00:00:06,652 --> 00:00:08,532
(Leonard:)And you were so good
in the TV commercial.

5
00:00:08,688 --> 00:00:11,528
It was for hemorrhoid cream.

6
00:00:11,691 --> 00:00:15,601
(Leonard:)And I got itchy and swollen
just watching you.

7
00:00:19,298 --> 00:00:21,108
(Penny:)Leonard, you are really
not cheering me up.

8
00:00:21,267 --> 00:00:23,607
(Leonard:)Come on. How can you be sad
when you're going home

9
00:00:23,769 --> 00:00:26,939
(Leonard:)with all five-foot-six of this?

10
00:00:27,707 --> 00:00:29,847
(Penny:)You think you're five-foot-six,
that's funny.

11
00:00:34,013 --> 00:00:35,493
(Raj:)I don't understand it.

12
00:00:35,648 --> 00:00:37,858
(Raj:)I'm a nice guy, I have a great job,

13
00:00:38,017 --> 00:00:41,187
(Raj:)I'm well-educated,
come from a good family...

14
00:00:41,354 --> 00:00:43,024
(Raj:)Why don't women want to be with me?

15
00:00:44,223 --> 00:00:46,363
(Sheldon:)An interesting question.

16
00:00:47,793 --> 00:00:50,133
(Sheldon:)Well... good night.

17
00:00:51,364 --> 00:00:55,374
(Raj:)What? Don't send me home.
I can't be alone right now.

18
00:00:55,535 --> 00:00:58,415
(Sheldon:)That's your problem.
You can't be alone.

